    alias: LINDECKER-Charles
repository-code: https://github.com/LINDECKER-Charles/App.GitHealth
url: https://github.com/LINDECKER-Charles/App.GitHealth
abstract: >-
  A local web application that analyses the branches of a Git repository against
  a baseline branch. It measures how far ahead and behind each branch is, its
  merge state, its activity and its contributors, in order to spot the ones that
  are merged, inactive, diverged or probably abandoned — without ever modifying
  the analysed repository or sending data to an external service.
